{"id": "EUVD-2026-107008", "enisaUuid": "dffb8aa8-a9b0-3939-8430-1ca59bddc86e", "description": "ArcadeDB from 26.2.1 before 26.10.1 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the Bolt protocol handler that allows authenticated users to enumerate all database names. Attackers with credentials for any single database can issue a SHOW DATABASES query over the Bolt port to reveal unauthorized database names, exposing tenant or project identifiers.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T00:36:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T18:00:21", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/ArcadeData/arcadedb/security/advisories/GHSA-7fcg-pg8x-wf7w", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/arcadedb-26.2.1-before-26.10.1-bolt-show-databases-information-disclosure"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-114057", "GHSA-vp2h-6426-v5wh"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "082f9a98-5493-36e9-9a79-5bdecd4abbd2", "product": {"name": "arcadedb", "vendor": {"name": "ArcadeData"}}, "product_version": "26.2.1 <26.10.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b81dd350-69cb-33f6-a9c8-73ac19909bb3", "vendor": {"name": "ArcadeData"}}], "isExploited": false}